From: attl8d <8817453+attl8d@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:25:55 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] macOS: apply plugin JS patches to steamloopback.host

- hhx64: hook cef_browser_host_create_browser on Apple Silicon with a MAP_JIT
  trampoline and a VM_PROT_COPY entry patch (libsnare's arm64 path needs RWX heap)
- pipe bootstrap: hand the browser Helper loopback IPC pipes on fds 5,6 next to
  the CDP pipes, and register them with the host when the CDP pipe connects
- url.rs: resolve steamui under Steam.AppBundle/Steam/Contents/MacOS

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
